<main id="main">

<section class="hero wrap">
  <h1>Know what your coding agents cost.</h1>
  <p class="hero-line">Skopli reads the usage 40 agent harnesses write to disk, prices it against live catalogs, and hands your code the total. Offline. No account.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://docs.skopli.com">Get started</a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/skopli/skopli"><svg class="btn-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"/></svg>GitHub</a>
  </div>
  <p class="hero-tag">MIT&#8202;·&#8202;Rust core, 9 language facades</p>

  <figure class="hero-fig">
    <div class="ledger-frame" role="group" aria-label="Example output table">
      <div class="code-head">
        <span class="file">rollup(events, {'{'} by: "model" {'}'})</span>
        <span class="reg">USD</span>
      </div>
      <table class="ledger">
        <caption class="visually-hidden">Example output: agent usage rolled up by model and priced. One model has no catalog match and is left unpriced.</caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Model</th>
            <th class="n hide-s">Input</th>
            <th class="n hide-s">Cache read</th>
            <th class="n hide-s">Cache write</th>
            <th class="n">Output</th>
            <th class="n">USD</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="model" title="anthropic/claude-opus-4.8">claude-opus-4.8</span></td>
            <td class="n hide-s">8,412,006</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">31,004,998</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">1,786,114</td>
            <td class="n">1,864,442</td>
            <td class="n usd priced">$115.34</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="model" title="openai/gpt-5.6-terra">gpt-5.6-terra</span></td>
            <td class="n hide-s">5,120,338</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">13,204,500</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">615,177</td>
            <td class="n">922,378</td>
            <td class="n usd priced">$25.49</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="model" title="google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview">gemini-3.1-pro-preview</span></td>
            <td class="n hide-s">9,887,412</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">16,902,776</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">761,716</td>
            <td class="n">1,103,266</td>
            <td class="n usd priced">$36.68</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="miss">
            <td>
              <span class="model" title="local-fine-tune">local-fine-tune</span>
              <span class="sources">attempted: openrouter · litellm · models.dev</span>
            </td>
            <td class="n hide-s">4,002,118</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">2,100,140</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">230,152</td>
            <td class="n">401,092</td>
            <td class="n"><span class="miss-tag">priced: false</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
        <tfoot>
          <tr>
            <td>4 models · 1 miss</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">27,421,874</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">63,212,414</td>
            <td class="n hide-s">3,393,159</td>
            <td class="n">4,291,178</td>
            <td class="n">$177.51</td>
          </tr>
        </tfoot>
