<section class="section wrap" id="languages">
  <h2>The same numbers in every language you ship.</h2>
  <div class="install-grid">
    <div class="install-row"><span class="ln">TypeScript</span><code>npm install skopli</code><span class="pm-alts"><button class="pm-chip" type="button" data-copy="pnpm add skopli" aria-label="Copy pnpm install command for TypeScript">pnpm</button><button class="pm-chip" type="button" data-copy="bun add skopli" aria-label="Copy bun install command for TypeScript">bun</button></span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="npm install skopli" aria-label="Copy install command for TypeScript"></button></div>
    <div class="install-row"><span class="ln">Python</span><code>pip install skopli</code><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="pip install skopli" aria-label="Copy install command for Python"></button></div>
    <div class="install-row"><span class="ln">Rust</span><code>cargo add skopli-core</code><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="cargo add skopli-core" aria-label="Copy install command for Rust"></button></div>
    <div class="install-row"><span class="ln">Ruby</span><code>gem install skopli</code><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="gem install skopli" aria-label="Copy install command for Ruby"></button></div>
    <div class="install-row"><span class="ln">Java</span><code>com.skopli:skopli</code><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="com.skopli:skopli" aria-label="Copy Maven coordinate for Java"></button></div>
    <div class="install-row"><span class="ln">C#</span><code>dotnet add package Skopli</code><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="dotnet add package Skopli" aria-label="Copy install command for C#"></button></div>
    <div class="install-row"><span class="ln">Go</span><code>go get github.com/skopli/skopli/sdks/go</code><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="go get github.com/skopli/skopli/sdks/go" aria-label="Copy install command for Go"></button></div>
    <div class="install-row"><span class="ln">Swift</span><code>https://github.com/skopli/skopli</code><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="https://github.com/skopli/skopli" aria-label="Copy Swift Package Manager URL"></button></div>
    <div class="install-row"><span class="ln">C ABI</span><code>cc app.c -lskopli</code><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="cc app.c -lskopli" aria-label="Copy link command for C ABI"></button></div>
  </div>
  <p class="note">Eight SDKs and a C ABI call one Rust core. A rollup in Python and a rollup in Go run the same code and return the same total.</p>
</section>

<section class="section wrap" id="layers">
  <h2>Three layers you can take one at a time.</h2>
  <div class="layers">
    <div class="layer">
      <h3>read</h3>
      <p>Parse local session state from 40 harnesses into one normalized event shape. Disk only, never the network. A file that will not parse returns a structured diagnostic, not a silent gap.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="layer">
      <h3>rollup</h3>
      <p>Aggregate events by model, session, harness, workspace, or day. Feed the result straight into pricing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="layer">
      <h3>price</h3>
      <p>Match models against OpenRouter, LiteLLM, and models.dev, then compute USD. Long-context tiers and Claude's 5-minute and 1-hour cache writes each bill at their own rate. An unmatched model returns <code>priced: false</code>, never a guess.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band" id="quickstart">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Four calls, local files to a priced total.</h2>
    <div class="quickstart">
      <div class="tabstrip" role="tablist" aria-label="Quickstart language" data-strip="quick">
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-lang="ts">TypeScript</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-lang="py">Python</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-lang="rs">Rust</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-lang="rb">Ruby</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-lang="java">Java</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-lang="cs">C#</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-lang="go">Go</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-lang="swift">Swift</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-lang="c">C/C++</button>
      </div>
      <div class="panels" data-panels="quick">
        <div class="panel" data-lang="ts" data-open="true"><div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="file">quickstart.ts</span><span class="reg">TypeScript</span></div><pre><code><span class="kw">import</span> {'{'} <span class="fn">readUsage</span><span class="pn">,</span> <span class="fn">rollup</span><span class="pn">,</span> <span class="fn">createPricing</span> {'}'} <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">"skopli"</span><span class="pn">;</span>

<span class="cm">// read local harness state into normalized events</span>
<span class="kw">const</span> {'{'} events {'}'} <span class="pn">=</span> <span class="kw">await</span> <span class="fn">readUsage</span><span class="pn">(</span>{'{'} since<span class="pn">:</span> <span class="str">"2026-08-01"</span> {'}'}<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="kw">const</span> byModel <span class="pn">=</span> <span class="fn">rollup</span><span class="pn">(</span>events<span class="pn">,</span> {'{'} by<span class="pn">:</span> <span class="str">"model"</span> {'}'}<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="kw">const</span> priced <span class="pn">=</span> <span class="kw">await</span> <span class="fn">createPricing</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">priceRollups</span><span class="pn">(</span>byModel<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="cm">// misses carry no usd, so they stay out of the total</span>
<span class="kw">const</span> total <span class="pn">=</span> priced<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">reduce</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">(</span>t<span class="pn">,</span> r<span class="pn">)</span> <span class="pn">=&gt;</span> t <span class="pn">+</span> <span class="pn">(</span>r<span class="pn">.</span>pricing<span class="pn">.</span>priced <span class="pn">?</span> r<span class="pn">.</span>pricing<span class="pn">.</span>usd <span class="pn">:</span> <span class="no">0</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">,</span> <span class="no">0</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="fn">console</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">log</span><span class="pn">(</span>total<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span> <span class="cm">// 177.51</span></code></pre></div></div>
        <div class="panel" data-lang="py"><div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="file">quickstart.py</span><span class="reg">Python</span></div><pre><code><span class="kw">import</span> skopli

result <span class="pn">=</span> skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">read_usage</span><span class="pn">(</span>since<span class="pn">=</span><span class="str">"2026-08-01"</span><span class="pn">)</span>
by_model <span class="pn">=</span> skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">rollup</span><span class="pn">(</span>result<span class="pn">.</span>events<span class="pn">,</span> <span class="str">"model"</span><span class="pn">)</span>
priced <span class="pn">=</span> skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">create_pricing</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">price_rollups</span><span class="pn">(</span>by_model<span class="pn">)</span>
total <span class="pn">=</span> <span class="fn">sum</span><span class="pn">(</span>r<span class="pn">.</span>usd <span class="kw">for</span> r <span class="kw">in</span> priced <span class="kw">if</span> r<span class="pn">.</span>pricing<span class="pn">.</span>priced<span class="pn">)</span>
<span class="fn">print</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="fn">round</span><span class="pn">(</span>total<span class="pn">,</span> <span class="no">2</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">)</span>  <span class="cm"># 177.51</span></code></pre></div></div>
        <div class="panel" data-lang="rs"><div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="file">main.rs</span><span class="reg">Rust</span></div><pre><code><span class="kw">use</span> skopli_core<span class="pn">::</span>rollup<span class="pn">::</span>{'{'}rollup<span class="pn">,</span> RollupBy<span class="pn">,</span> RollupOptions{'}'}<span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="kw">use</span> skopli_core<span class="pn">::</span>pricing<span class="pn">::</span>{'{'}Pricing<span class="pn">,</span> PricingMode<span class="pn">,</span> RollupPricing{'}'}<span class="pn">;</span>

<span class="cm">// the core takes pre-fetched catalogs; it never opens a socket itself</span>
<span class="kw">let</span> by_model <span class="pn">=</span> <span class="fn">rollup</span><span class="pn">(</span>&amp;events<span class="pn">,</span> &amp;RollupOptions<span class="pn">::</span><span class="fn">new</span><span class="pn">(</span>RollupBy<span class="pn">::</span>Model<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="kw">let</span> pricing <span class="pn">=</span> Pricing<span class="pn">::</span><span class="fn">new</span><span class="pn">(</span>catalogs<span class="pn">,</span> <span class="fn">None</span><span class="pn">,</span> PricingMode<span class="pn">::</span>Calculate<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="cm">// misses carry no usd, so they stay out of the total</span>
<span class="kw">let</span> total<span class="pn">:</span> <span class="kw">f64</span> <span class="pn">=</span> pricing<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">price_rollups</span><span class="pn">(</span>&amp;by_model<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">iter</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span>
    <span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">filter_map</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">|</span>r<span class="pn">|</span> <span class="kw">match</span> r<span class="pn">.</span>pricing {'{'} RollupPricing<span class="pn">::</span>Hit {'{'} usd<span class="pn">,</span> <span class="pn">..</span> {'}'} <span class="pn">=&gt;</span> <span class="fn">Some</span><span class="pn">(</span>usd<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">,</span> _ <span class="pn">=&gt;</span> <span class="fn">None</span> {'}'}<span class="pn">)</span>
    <span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">sum</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="fn">println!</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="str">"{'{'}total:.2{'}'}"</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span> <span class="cm">// 177.51</span></code></pre></div></div>
        <div class="panel" data-lang="rb"><div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="file">quickstart.rb</span><span class="reg">Ruby</span></div><pre><code><span class="kw">require</span> <span class="str">"skopli"</span>

result <span class="pn">=</span> Skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">read_usage</span><span class="pn">(</span>since<span class="pn">:</span> <span class="str">"2026-08-01"</span><span class="pn">)</span>
by_model <span class="pn">=</span> Skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">rollup</span><span class="pn">(</span>result<span class="pn">.</span>events<span class="pn">,</span> <span class="str">:model</span><span class="pn">)</span>
priced <span class="pn">=</span> Skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">create_pricing</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">price_rollups</span><span class="pn">(</span>by_model<span class="pn">)</span>
total <span class="pn">=</span> priced<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">select</span> {'{'} <span class="pn">|</span>r<span class="pn">|</span> r<span class="pn">.</span>pricing<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">priced</span> {'}'}<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">sum</span><span class="pn">(</span>&amp;<span class="str">:usd</span><span class="pn">)</span>
<span class="fn">puts</span> total<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">round</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="no">2</span><span class="pn">)</span>  <span class="cm"># 177.51</span></code></pre></div></div>
        <div class="panel" data-lang="java"><div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="file">Quickstart.java</span><span class="reg">Java</span></div><pre><code><span class="kw">import</span> com<span class="pn">.</span>skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="pn">*</span><span class="pn">;</span>

<span class="kw">var</span> result <span class="pn">=</span> Skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">readUsage</span><span class="pn">(</span>ReadUsageOptions<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">builder</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">since</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="str">"2026-08-01"</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">build</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="kw">var</span> byModel <span class="pn">=</span> Skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">rollup</span><span class="pn">(</span>result<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">events</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">,</span> RollupOptions<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">by</span><span class="pn">(</span>RollupBy<span class="pn">.</span>MODEL<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
<span class="kw">try</span> <span class="pn">(</span><span class="kw">var</span> pricing <span class="pn">=</span> Skopli<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">createPricing</span><span class="pn">(</span>PricingOptions<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">builder</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">build</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">)</span> {'{'}
    <span class="kw">double</span> total <span class="pn">=</span> <span class="no">0</span><span class="pn">;</span>
    <span class="kw">for</span> <span class="pn">(</span><span class="kw">var</span> row <span class="pn">:</span> pricing<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">priceRollups</span><span class="pn">(</span>byModel<span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">)</span>
        total <span class="pn">+=</span> row<span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">pricing</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">usd</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">.</span><span class="fn">orElse</span><span class="pn">(</span><span class="no">0</span><span class="pn">)</span><span class="pn">;</span>
